IDENTIFICATION DIVISION. PROGRAM-ID. T. DATA DIVISION. WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
01 WS-VYBE-N PIC 9(9)V9(4) VALUE 0. 01 V PIC X VALUE 'A'. PROCEDURE DIVISION. DISPLAY FUNCTION ORD(V).
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    COMPUTE WS-VYBE-N = FUNCTION ORD(V)
