    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "0000000660000"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [0000000660000] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF. STOP RUN.

